<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/36/eng@/~cl_11__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: \" (2) A prescribed security may at any time after the prescribed date— (a) be deposited by a depositor with the central depository; and (b) such security shall not be capable of being utilised to settle a transaction which took place on a stock market of a stock exchange prior to the date of deposit of that security.\"; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/36/eng@> .
