<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/36/eng@/~cl_32> <https://schema.org/text> "section 61 the following section: 61. (1) No prosecution for any offence under this Act shall be instituted except with the consent in writing of the Public Prosecutor. (2) Any officer of the Commission who is authorised by the Chairman of the Commission may conduct any prosecution of any offence under this Act. (3) For the purpose of subsection (2), \"officer\" has the same meaning as in section 2 of the Securities Commission Act 1993.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/36/eng@> .
